  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020020,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "それで……ほいっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あさひ、おはよう\r\n随分と早く来てるんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020030,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "うーん……ちょっと違う……\r\nここをこうして……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（すごい集中力だな……よし、終わるまで少し待とう）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020040,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "よしっ……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あさひ、おはよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020050,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "あ、プロデューサーさん、おはよーっす！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、初日から気合が入ってて感心するぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020060,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "早くやりたくなったんすよ！\r\nこの前見せてもらった映像がすごくて",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、それにしてもすごい集中力だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020070,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "？　どういうことっすか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺の声が全然聞こえないくらい集中してたみたいだから\r\n感心してたんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020080,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "そーだったんすね……気付かなかったっす",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（集中すると回りが見えなくなるのか……\r\n気を付けてあげないと）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020090,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "ところで、プロデューサーさんは何の用っすか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "初回のレッスンだからな、立ち合いをしようと思ってるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020100,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "へ～、そうだったんすね",
    "charAnim1": "think1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020110,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "それじゃ、わたし張り切っていきますんで\r\n見ててほしいっす、プロデューサーさん！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや……この後のレッスンでしっかり見るから大丈夫──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020120,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "……すぅ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_a",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020130,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "……っ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（もう聞こえてないみたいだな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
