  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あさひ、お疲れ様",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020140,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "お疲れさまっす、プロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "初回のレッスンにしては、よくできて──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020150,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "うーん……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あさひ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020160,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "あ！　さっきのとこ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020170,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "さっきのとこなんすよ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020170"
  },
  {
    "select": "ステップのところだな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "びっくりした",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "気になるところが\r\nあるんだな",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020180,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "そーっす！\r\nプロデューサーさん、わかってたっすね！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020190,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "どうすればいいっすかね！？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もっと体にステップを覚えさせることからだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ひとつひとつのポーズの完成形を意識しながらだな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020200,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "ふんふん……そうなんすね……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "っと、すまないな、難しかったよな\r\n初回にしては充分できて──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020210,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "え！　もっと聞かせてほしいっすよー！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そうか、わかった、じゃあ続けるぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020220,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "はいっす～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "off",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いきなり大きな声を出して、どうしたんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020230,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "もっといい感じにできるんじゃないかって思うんすよ！\r\nさっきのステップ！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、ステップのことを考えていたのか\r\nずいぶん真剣に悩んでるんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020240,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "そうなんすよー\r\n映像だともっとスムーズに次のステップに移ってるんすけど",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020250,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "──直前の足の引きつけが甘いのかな……？\r\nそれとも次のステップを意識できてないだけ……？",
    "charAnim1": "think1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あさひ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020260,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "あ、どしたっすか？　プロデューサーさん？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、いや……\r\nそこまで考えが及ぶなら、初日としては充分すぎるくらいだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020270,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "うーん、プロデューサーさんがそう言うなら\r\nそういうことにしとくっす！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（この子はもしかしたら……）",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "off",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なら、この後とことんやってみようか\r\n丁度レッスン場も空いてるみたいだし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020280,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "ホントっすか！　感謝するっす！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、だけど無理は禁物だぞ\r\n課題を克服できたら、今日のレッスンはおしまいだからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020290,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "オッケーっす！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020290"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020300,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "よーし、とことんやるっすよ～\r\nあはは、なんかワクワクするっす！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020300"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001020310,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "まずは最初のステップなんすけどね──",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700102/1017001020310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（──少し突っ走りがちだけど、本当に熱心だ\r\nこれからが楽しみだな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
